{# Language switcher. `languages` is built by the backend and holds a ready-made
   URL for the current page in each locale, so switching is a navigation rather
   than client-side state: the copy is server-rendered and the URL is what
   Cloudflare keys its cache on. Hidden unless the shop enables more than one.

   Flag art is inlined and simplified to what reads at 16px: the selector renders
   in the navbar and the footer of every page, and a sprite or CDN icon would cost
   a request per placement for a graphic that small. Locales without art fall back
   to the code badge. Paths are derived from flag-icons (MIT).

